description.en:
This dataset contains the results produced by running PathoSeq-QC v.2 (with default parameters) on a sample of A(H5N1) virus (Run ID: SRR29851702) and a sample of Oropouche virus (Run ID: SRR14711849). The A(H5N1) virus reference sequence used for the H5N1 analyses is provided within the PathoSeq-QC repository. The Oropouche virus reference sequences used can be found with the following IDs:

>NC_005775.1 Oropouche virus segment M, complete sequence;
>NC_005776.1 Oropouche virus segment L, complete genome;
>NC_005777.1 Oropouche virus segment S, complete genome.

A full description on how to understand the outputs and visualisations produced can be found at: https://code.europa.eu/dighealth/pathoseq-qc/

description.it:
